oints and no runner or truth changes;\n- committed compact candidate results, raw-response hash inventory, residual packet, freeze/readback receipts, suspected-truth packet, and the concise report.\n\n## Result\n\n- attempted / terminal / unique: 108 / 108 / 108; silent missing: 0;\n- first-pass fully correct: 82/108 (75.925926%);\n- final two-pass fully correct: 98/108 (90.740741%);\n- strict schema: 108/108; question number 103/108; subparts 100/108; marks 98/108; candidate writing 103/108; foreign annotation 103/108;\n- mark overrides 17; false overrides 0; mismatches 1; fallbacks 6;\n- local calls 216; retries 0; provider failures 0;\n- paid external calls and remote/canonical/production/public writes: 0.\n\nThe ten residual IDs and grouped failure analysis are in the report. Five responses were unnormalizable and five were model disagreements. No suspected truth error was found. This result does not justify automatic canonical eligibility.\n\nA harness finding is preserved rather than repaired: the initial in-memory finalization and first checkpoint-only reconstruction differed only in summary/residual compact-artifact hashes; checkpoint, candidate results, raw hash inventory, scores, counts, and IDs were unchanged, and subsequent checkpoint-only reconstructions were byte-stable. A separate successor investigation is recommended.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1629_holdout.test.py` - 5/5\n- `python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1627_residual_repair.test.py` - 23/23\n- `python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1621_unseen_batch.test.py` - 11/11\n- `python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1620_local_two_pass.test.py` - 24/24\n- `npm run quality:report-index` - pass, 0 violations\n- `npm run build` - pass\n- `npm run deploy:secret-scan` - pass, 0 findings\n- `git diff --check` - pass\n- final preflight - expected warnings only for task changes/upstream before commit; substantive guards healthy","created_at":"2026-07-20T06:22:08Z","updated_at":"2026